# Licence for the example site's content

The content in `exampleSite/content/` and the photo in `exampleSite/static/images/`
are from Not a Chef (https://github.com/robotpony/not-a-chef), a family cookbook by
Bruce Alderson, copyright © 1995-2026 Bruce Alderson.

They are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
License (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Changes from the originals: a selection of pages; wiki links to pages not included
here are plain text, and some "Recipes" and "Notes" lines that only pointed at those
pages are removed; the About page is new; the photo is resized.

The example site's configuration (`hugo.toml`) and the icon in `assets/` are part of
Fugu and under its MIT licence (../LICENSE).
